6-03-05）","created_by":"rule","direction":"in","title":"京东Q4电话会披露言犀大模型调用量激增与AI导购数据","company":"jd","event_date":"2026-03-05"},{"other":"EV-de871aa3","relation":"same_actor_track","basis":"同为 jd 的动作，时间相邻（2026-03-05 → 2026-03-11）","created_by":"rule","direction":"out","title":"京东升级“春晓计划”并免费开放14款京麦AI工具","company":"jd","event_date":"2026-03-11"}]}